      "role": "Chef",
      "bio": "As a culinary maestro with more than 20 years of experience, chef Ivan Rogulj is passionate about creating and designing impressive dishes, combining flavors and textures with local ingredients. Off-season, he works in the top restaurants in Split, so he is kept up-to-date on the latest culinary trends and the best seasonal fare. He also designs a wide variety of menu selections, such as gluten-free or vegan menu options.\n\nDuring his leisure hours, the chef enjoys singing and all sorts of water sports.\n\nLanguages Spoken:\nEnglish, Croatian"
