      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Armed with a Bachelor's degree in International Business from RIT Croatia, this individual is fluent in both English and German. Renowned for his strong work ethic, he maintains excellent communication with guests and readily assists them with any needs throughout their cruise experience.\n\nLanguages Spoken:\nEnglish, German, Croatian"
